## B. Programme management

Allow authorized organizations to:

- Create programmes.
- Publish awareness activities.
- Publish prevention initiatives.
- Publish educational events.
- Publish professional training.
- Publish community support activities.
- Update programme details.
- Manage registration.
- Track participation.
